s Charles tries desperately to salvage his dream gig.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Eccentric lottery winner Charles dreams of getting his favorite musicians, McGwyer Mortimer, back together. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"moderate bad language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-30\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":100,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=T9smxlnKNz0\",\"displayPriority\":5,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003501\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003970\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004380\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011120\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011121\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011122\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011123\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000003\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"4c563f44-cfa4-4914-86b1-b510771045c8\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006099\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007519\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Universal Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006101\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Salt Path\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"THE SALT PATH is the profound true story of husband and wife, Raynor and Moth Winn’s 630-mile trek along the beautiful but rugged Cornish, Devon and Dorset coastline. After being forcibly removed from their home, they make the desperate decision to walk in the hope that, in nature, they will find solace and a sense of acceptance. With depleted resources, only a tent and some essentials between them, every step along the path is a testament to their growing strength and determination. THE SALT PATH is a journey that is exhilarating, challenging, and liberating in equal measure. A portrayal of home, how it can be lost and rediscovered in the most unexpected ways.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"THE SALT PATH is the profound true story of husband and wife, Raynor and Moth Winn’s 630-mile trek along the beautiful but rugged Cornish, Devon and Dorset coastline. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"infrequent strong language, moderate sex, drug misuse\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-30\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":115,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UQ7RJCOm-c8\",\"displayPriority\":3,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001890\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001891\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002998\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004583\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011130\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011131\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011132\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011133\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011134\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011135\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011136\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011137\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011138\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011139\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"b7f9da6c-7b33-44f6-8667-f9f496405624\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006101\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007521\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Black Bear\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006199\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Hidden (Caché)\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"A married couple is terrorized by a series of surveillance videotapes left on their front porch.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"A married couple is terrorized by a series of surveillance videotapes left on their front porch.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-20\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":118,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003240\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004195\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011332\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011334\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011380\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011394\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011412\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"8d52e414-ea56-449f-949a-6cbcfa55a8b7\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006199\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007654\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Curzon\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006278\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Darling (60th Anniversary 4K Restoration)\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"A beautiful but amoral model sleeps her way to the top of the London fashion scene at the height of the Swinging Sixties.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Beautiful but amoral model Diana Scott sleeps her way to the top of the London fashion scene at the height of the Swinging Sixties.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"VS00000007\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-30\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":128,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010274\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011658\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011659\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011660\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011661\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011662\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011663\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000061\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000033\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"8494a08e-5d82-44a7-9647-d1c920529122\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006278\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007745\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Studio Canal\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006204\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"28 Years Later\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Academy Award®-winning director Danny Boyle and Academy Award®-nominated writer Alex Garland reunite for 28 Years Later, a terrifying new story set in the world created by 28 Days Later. It’s been almost three decades since the rage virus escaped a biological weapons laboratory, and now, still in a ruthlessly enforced quarantine, some have found ways to exist amidst the infected. One such group of survivors lives on a small island connected to the mainland by a single, heavily-defended causeway. When one of the group leaves the island on a mission into the dark heart of the mainland, he discovers secrets, wonders, and horrors that have mutated not only the infected but other survivors as well.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"It’s been almost three decades since the rage virus escaped a biological weapons laboratory, and now, still in a ruthlessly enforced quarantine...\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-19\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":115,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=poEFz8Ivzug\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000313\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001100\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001270\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003206\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003678\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004531\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":